{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1758891,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Digital Poster Creation","festival_id":515345,"organization_id":1004474,"web_url":"qffsrmap2026.vercel.app","start_date":"2026-09-23T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-12T23:59:14+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/digital-poster-creation-srm-university-ap-1758891","region":"online","details":"<h2>All That You Need to Know About the Digital Poster Creation Competition<\/h2>\n<p>The <strong>Digital Poster Creation Competition<\/strong> is part of <strong>Day 2<\/strong> of Qiskit Fall Fest 2026 at <strong>SRM University-AP, Amaravati<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>Unleash your creativity and visual storytelling skills by designing an original digital poster inspired by quantum computing, emerging technologies, and the future of innovation.<\/p>\n<p>Participants can choose <strong>one of the following four themes<\/strong>:<\/p>\n<h3>Competition Themes<\/h3>\n<ol start=\"1\">\n<li>\n<p><strong>A Decade of Quantum on the Cloud:<\/strong> Celebrating a decade of accessible quantum computing and exploring the future of quantum technology.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Quantum Reference Facility at SRM University-AP:<\/strong> Showcase the significance of SRM University-AP&rsquo;s Quantum Reference Facility and its role in advancing quantum research, hardware validation, and India's quantum innovation ecosystem.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>The Future of Quantum:<\/strong> Imagine how quantum computing and emerging quantum technologies could transform science, industries, and everyday life in the years ahead.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Open Theme &ndash; Beyond the Quantum Horizon:<\/strong> Explore any original idea, creative vision, or perspective related to quantum science, quantum computing, and the possibilities of a quantum-powered future.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3>Submission Guidelines<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Create an original digital poster based on <strong>one of the four approved themes<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Publish your final poster on your <strong>public social media account<\/strong>.(preferably Instagram)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Tag the designated official Qiskit Fall Fest 2026 social media account and use the official event hashtag.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Submit the <strong>public post link<\/strong> through the official Unstop submission round.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Ensure your post remains publicly accessible until the results are announced.<\/p>\n<p>#QiskitFallFest #QFF26 #IBMQuantum #QuantumComputing #Qiskit #PartnerPlus #SRMUniversityAP #AmaravatiQuantumValley #QuantumEducation #QuantumInnovation #FutureTech #Innovation<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Note:<\/strong> All posters must be original and submitted within the specified submission period. Late submissions and links to private or inaccessible posts will not be considered.<\/p>\n<p>For more information about the Quantum Reference Facility at SRM University-AP, visit: <a href=\"https:\/\/www.srmap.edu.in\/qrc\/\">https:\/\/www.srmap.edu.in\/qrc\/<\/a><\/p>","overall_prizes":"Certifications will be provided for participants","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":33285520,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-09-20T15:59:40+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-05T07:21:41+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"general_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"7dT0Hma","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":2,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":55,"referral_leaderboard_show":0